{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心停下，却放不下那些珍惜的东西，连该往哪边使劲都定不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"珍惜的东西\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他惦记的那些东西，连着他想亲近、安心过日子的愿望。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心过日子\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时只顾眼前能做的事，松快了一会儿。可向往的日子还没过上，当初那个决定又压回心头，他得重新面对它。\",\n      \"key\": \"压回心头\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R11\", \"R12\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不甘停下与舍不得珍惜之物写成同一处拉扯，解释躁动和方向难定。跨段理由改由S02-3提供，不再用压住难过来解释方向难定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R12\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把温柔背后的牵挂落到他想亲近、安心过日子的愿望上。删除S02-3到这一条的箭头，因为前段只说明他惦记珍惜之物，并未说明这些东西为何连着这样的愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R12\", \"R13\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留短暂松快和旧决定重现，补出向往的日子尚未实现这一触发点，并恢复旧决定再次成为必须面对之事的压力。删除S02-1到这一条的箭头，因为决定本身是回想的内容，不是回想发生的原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6fb4d7ae-b6bd-4f9f-9b71-622c4f54f908", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T065040348708Z", "elapsed_seconds": 249.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:54:49.934141+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3a4a3e728cf75e2bcae982b2b070e5b0725323f5101b87bd7649fa0429bd8f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T065040348708Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "299a026734443a630b2a80dd6ef21e72db0e1c37b175ca641bd0468c3813f45c"}}}
